<div data-controller="dialog" data-dialog-auto-open-value="true" data-dialog-modal-value="true">
  <dialog class="welcome-letter panel panel--wide shadow dialog" data-dialog-target="dialog">
    <button class="welcome-letter__close btn txt-x-small" data-action="dialog#close">
      <%= icon_tag "close" %>
      <span class="for-screen-reader">Close dialog</span>
    </button>

    <div class="txt-align-center margin-block-end">
      <span class="welcome-letter__avatar txt-xx-large avatar center"><%= image_tag "clinclaw-mark.png", size: 36 %></span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="txt-medium margin-none txt-tight-lines">Welcome, and thanks for signing up for ClinClaw.</h2>

    <p></p>

    <p>To get you started, we set you up with a ClinClaw board called <em>Playground</em>. It’s got a few cards designed to help you learn ClinClaw itself. Open each card, go through the simple steps, and you’ll be an expert in ClinClaw in no time. You’ll see the <em>Playground</em> when you close this message.</p>

    <p>If you need a hand, email <a href="mailto:requests@send.clinclaw.com">requests@send.clinclaw.com</a>.</p>

    <p>Thanks again and all the best,</p>

    <p><strong>ClinClaw Operations</strong></p>
  </dialog>
</div>
